  "body": "On matrix.org we discovered that every now and again `event_search` queries would take forever due to using the wrong query plan. This was due to Postgres underestimating the number of room IDs that existed. \r\n\r\nTo fix this we should add a schema update with:\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nALTER TABLE event_search ALTER COLUMN room_id SET (n_distinct = -0.01);\r\n```\r\n\r\nlike we do for `state_groups_state.state_group` already.",
